OL,3,GNEWSA'An utter disgrace' - reaction as 
OL,4,ATranslink off-peak discount ends       
OL,6,FThere are no changes to standard fares 
OL,7,Fwhich have been frozen since June 2024 
OL,8,Fand the 50% discount offered to 16-23  
OL,9,Fyear-olds with a yLink card is also    
OL,10,Funchanged.                             
